g=\"ja\">ひど.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">残酷</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ざんこく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">残忍；残酷；无情；冷酷；不人道</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷酷</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れいこく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冷酷；无情；残忍</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">宰</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>管理；统治；主管</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">廊</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>走廊；大厅；塔楼</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">廊下</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろうか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">走廊；过道；通道</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">寂</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>寂寞；寂静；古朴雅致；铜绿；圆寂</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジャク・セキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さび・さび.しい・さび.れる・さみ.しい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寂しい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さびしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">孤独；寂寞；冷清；荒凉</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">辰</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>龙（十二生肖第五位）；辰时（上午七至九点）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン・ジン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たつ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">霞</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>薄雾；云霞；朦胧；模糊</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ・ゲ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かすみ・かす.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">霞む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かすむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">变得朦胧；变得模糊；笼罩上薄雾；变得模糊；变暗淡；变朦胧；被掩盖；被抢风头；黯然失色</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">伏</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>俯伏；卧倒；覆盖；隐藏；弯下</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふ.せる・ふ.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">起伏</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きふく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">起伏；波动；浮沉；起伏；兴衰</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">降伏</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうふく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">投降；屈服；归顺；（工程）屈服（材料受力超限后产生塑性变形）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">碁</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>围棋</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt>